      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The following code adds a custom graph compile message callback function that prints [`BNNSGraphMessageLevelInfo`](bnnsgraphmessagelevelinfo.md) level messages to the console:",
      "normalizedSource": "The following code adds a custom graph compile message callback function that prints [`BNNSGraphMessageLevelInfo`](bnnsgraphmessagelevelinfo.md) level messages to the console:",
      "sourceHash": "830b2a6e4f200d6745eff94ef543e1bfaa153cfb759c25f4f42cb7323725e505",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "If you don’t specify this callback, default callback functions log messages to [`os_log`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/os/os_log).",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nlet options = BNNSGraphCompileOptionsMakeDefault()\ndefer {\n    BNNSGraphCompileOptionsDestroy(options)\n}\n\nBNNSGraphCompileOptionsSetMessageLogMask(options, BNNSGraphMessageLevelInfo.rawValue)\nBNNSGraphCompileOptionsSetMessageLogCallback(options, messageLogCallback, nil)\n\nfunc messageLogCallback(msg_level: BNNSGraphMessageLevel,\n                        error_msg: UnsafePointer<CChar>,\n                        source_location: UnsafePointer<CChar>?,\n                        user_message_data_t:UnsafeMutablePointer<user_message_data_t>?) {\n    \n    print(NSString(cString: error_msg, encoding: NSUTF8StringEncoding) ?? \"\")\n    if let source_location = source_location {\n        print(NSString(cString: source_location, encoding: NSUTF8StringEncoding) ?? \"\")\n    }\n}\n```",
      "documentTitle": "BNNSGraphCompileOptionsSetMessageLogCallback(:::)",
      "framework": "Accelerate",
